### Remaining endpoints: promotions, price changes, stock, customers, loyalty, credit

@catalog = http://localhost:8081
@customer = http://localhost:8082
@order = http://localhost:8083

### --- catalog -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### C3 create a product
POST {{catalog}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "NEW-0001", "name": "New gadget", "category": "TOYS", "basePrice": 10.00, "weightKg": 0.5, "stockQuantity": 5 }

### C4 price change: dropping the base price by more than 50% is refused (400)
PUT {{catalog}}/products/ELC-3001/price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "basePrice": 10.00 }

### C4 start a sale (salePrice must stay below basePrice)
PUT {{catalog}}/products/ELC-3001/price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salePrice": 24.90 }

### C4 end the sale ("salePrice": null)
PUT {{catalog}}/products/ELC-3001/price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salePrice": null }

### C5 reserve stock (an existing orderRef is only extended)
POST {{catalog}}/stock/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderRef": "DEMO-1", "items": [ { "sku": "TOY-6001", "qty": 2 } ] }

### C5 same orderRef again: EXTENDED, quantities are not added twice
POST {{catalog}}/stock/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderRef": "DEMO-1", "items": [ { "sku": "TOY-6001", "qty": 2 } ], "ttlMinutes": 30 }

### C7 confirm the reservation (stock exit)
POST {{catalog}}/stock/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderRef": "DEMO-1" }

### C7 put it back
POST {{catalog}}/stock/confirm?restock=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderRef": "DEMO-1", "items": [ { "sku": "TOY-6001", "qty": 2 } ] }

### C6 release (nothing left to release here)
POST {{catalog}}/stock/release
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderRef": "DEMO-1" }

### C8 promo validation. WELCOME10 (first order only), SAVE5 (min 30), BOOKS15, OLD20 (expired), LIMITED (exhausted), MEGA25
GET {{catalog}}/promotions/validate?code=WELCOME10&customerId=1

###
GET {{catalog}}/promotions/validate?code=WELCOME10&customerId=7

###
GET {{catalog}}/promotions/validate?code=SAVE5&subtotal=20

###
GET {{catalog}}/promotions/validate?code=OLD20

###
GET {{catalog}}/promotions/validate?code=LIMITED

### C9 create a promotion
POST {{catalog}}/promotions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "SPRING20", "type": "PERCENT", "value": 20, "minOrderAmount": 50, "validFrom": "2026-01-01", "validTo": "2026-12-31", "maxUsage": 100, "allowedCategories": "HOME,SPORT", "firstOrderOnly": false }

### --- customers -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### U1 register (errors come back as HTTP 200 with status ERROR)
POST {{customer}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "new.b2b@example.com", "type": "B2B", "companyName": "Widgets Ltd", "vatNumber": "FR98765432109",
  "addresses": [ { "country": "fr", "city": "Paris", "line": "1 avenue de l'Opera", "defaultShipping": true } ] }

### U1 invalid B2B (no VAT number)
POST {{customer}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bad.b2b@example.com", "type": "B2B", "companyName": "Widgets Ltd" }

### U2 profile
GET {{customer}}/customers/2

### U3 replace the addresses (max 5, exactly one default)
PUT {{customer}}/customers/2/addresses
Content-Type: application/json

[ { "country": "FR", "city": "Lyon", "line": "5 place Bellecour", "defaultShipping": true },
  { "country": "BE", "city": "Brussels", "line": "Rue Neuve 10", "defaultShipping": false } ]

### U4 loyalty balance
GET {{customer}}/customers/2/loyalty

### U5 earn (negative points = clawback)
POST {{customer}}/customers/2/loyalty/earn
Content-Type: application/json

{ "points": 250, "orderRef": "MANUAL" }

### U6 redeem (negative = give back); orderAmount is needed for the 50% rule
POST {{customer}}/customers/2/loyalty/redeem
Content-Type: application/json

{ "points": 200, "orderAmount": 100, "orderRef": "MANUAL" }

### U7 credit
GET {{customer}}/customers/5/credit

### U8 consume credit (negative = release)
POST {{customer}}/customers/5/credit/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00 }

###
POST {{customer}}/customers/5/credit/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": -100.00 }

### U9 blacklist / unblock
POST {{customer}}/customers/3/blacklist

###
POST {{customer}}/customers/3/blacklist?value=false
